ale mit Tropen, Graduale mit Sequenzen</term></termList></classification><itemList><item><identifier type="shelfmark">Royal 2 B. IV</identifier><physLoc><repository><geogName role="settlement">London</geogName><corpName>British Library</corpName></repository></physLoc></item></itemList></manifestation></manifestationList><revisionDesc><change isodate="2026-11-04"><changeDesc><p>Exported with Monodi-Zero 0.9.1.</p></changeDesc></change></revisionDesc></meiHead><music><body><mdiv type="main"><score><scoreDef><staffGrp><staffDef n="1" notationtype="neume" lines="5" clef.shape="G" clef.line="2"/></staffGrp></scoreDef><section xml:id="m-1551ac51-c127-4d68-8bd5-6e1c380b7e5b"><section xml:id="m-770280f3-d2ef-4557-8d38-61e6f4c2568f" type="Einsatzmarke"><sb xml:id="m-0fe15044-07d8-4e0b-aa96-a2475208568c"/><staff n="1"><layer n="1"><syllable xml:id="m-14df95d5-e5f3-4754-8246-cb0a418aed50"><syl wordpos="i" con="d">San-</syl><accid xml:id="m-dae35225-f773-41c4-90cc-7478b4985224" accid="n" ploc="b" oloc="4"/><neume><nc xml:id="m-aa8cfc1b-20ef-4aae-aaae-9a55eda75c4b" pname="g" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-07244d2b-5ec4-4c8c-a6b7-649c2b1d015c" pname="c" oct="5"/><nc xml:id="m-ac4eec3c-ec97-4d99-a407-890fedad19ee" pname="a" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-1f64e6ee-df97-428b-bdb1-0512e31a386b" pname="g" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-bc9ba059-7268-41c6-839b-dd9fef7025f0" pname="e" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-5aee1992-7bd8-41bb-9d44-77c6655122cc" pname="f" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-f6dc382b-34ea-4f0f-88e1-39fd5ba600f8" pname="g" oct="4"><liquescent/></nc></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-e9cd0dad-1b76-4251-a234-df77887ca224"><syl wordpos="t">ctus</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-956d769b-3282-4066-a0ac-875888706e1f" pname="g" oct="4"/></neume></syllable></layer></staff></section><section xml:id="m-8650a9f5-1ea9-41ec-aa5e-d29be3bf8e14" label="A" type="Tropenelement"><sb xml:id="m-96eb3824-ddc2-4c6c-8b1f-6e7543c8ee6f"/><staff n="1"><layer n="1"><syllable xml:id="m-03919d75-021c-46d0-a2d